Z||000003||mbramble||05-29-2001||01:53 PM||||You don't say what year your SE is.  Obviously not an 84 since it has a V6.  If it is an 85 then it would have the same front fascia as the base coupe -- with the black 'pads' on it.  If it is an 86 or 87 SE, then it would have had the same front fascia as the GT's.  The hood is the same for all years and the only difference in the fenders is whether or not they have the ground effects pieces mounted on them (86,87 SE did, 85 didn't).  In my view it doesn't look right to have the aero fascia (from the GT's, Indy, 86-87 SE's) unless you also install the ground effects and aero rocker panels and rear fascia.  I have just the aero front fascia on my 87 coupe and though I still like it better than the coupe nose, it doesn't look quite right w/o the rest of the aero package installed.  I will either go back to a standard coupe nose or complete the aero package install -- one day!!<P>Check in the Mall to see if someone has whichever fascia that you decide to go with available.||||reg||1
